{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.nichika.call",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "手机连着三条「来一下」",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.nichika.call",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.nichika.call",
    "idolId": "nichika",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（楼层经理在跟人聊店里的事。）",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……啊，にちか。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "────哇。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "说了不用来接我的吧──这样会被举报的哦，这种事。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……你要举报吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……要是你觉得我不会，那我就举报！",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……抱歉。我是来看看你的。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……那个，那的话我超级有精神！没有闲下来的时间。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "啊，不过现在这段时间不算工作，所以全都会被当成『闲』也说不定！",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "什么叫不算工作……我没说过那种话。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……啊哈哈，这样啊──那，是我不对呢！我走了。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那个……！等等！我没打算硬送你────",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "にちか要是有精神，那就好了……我只是想确认这一点。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "那，现在就可以回去了吧……！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯、嗯……不过，让我再说一句────",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（楼层经理在旁边插了一句。）",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "用那种话让人感动之类的，超级勉强所以不行……！",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……我有点明白。自己知道自己在说什么，也正因为如此才会受伤。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……不是那样。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（经理说：她嘴硬，其实对自己没信心。）",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "没关系，嗯……不是想让她感动……",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……我是真的希望她明白。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（经理又说：我们给不了免费的『心』。）",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我今天就回去了……但随时可以联络我。需要的话。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "はづきさん也在，职场的同伴也在。也许我帮不上什么忙，但──",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我在，是为了にちか。只要にちか还在这里。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……超级火大。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……这样啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……没跟制作人先生说。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "超级火大，超级火大超级火大──────",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────还是，我送你吧。不上车吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "────不行呢──",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "不过……也许会联络你。毕竟你说了随时，那我就随时。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦……！电话也好什么都好……不接的话，打一拳也行。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────（手机连着响。）",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "『店里，请马上过来』『快点』『已经结束了』",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……正好顺路。不过にちか今天也没有课……会是什么呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "────啊哈哈，糟糕──！前辈那样会被人讨厌的，真的──！",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……にちか……？",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "（前辈们笑着，说她也是，然后说该回去了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "好──",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────哦，那个…………",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "啊哈哈，真的来了──",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "是你自己说什么都可以说的……",
        "nextNodeId": "46"
      },
      "46": {
        "id": "46",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──辛苦了。"
      }
    }
  },
